  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Bonded Casting</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may select an additional creature as your bonded creature. So long as at least one of them is alive and within close range, you may spend spell points and use magic sphere effects normally.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> you may select this feat multiple times, each time gaining a different bonded creature.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Glorious Arena</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc48\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
